sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Device Owner / Admin
    participant HostUI as Host Machine (Tauri UI)
    participant HostDaemon as Host Background Daemon
    participant API as OpenDesk API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    Admin->>HostUI: Open Settings -> "Bind Device to My Account"
    HostUI->>HostDaemon: Request Hardware Pairing Token
    Note over HostDaemon: Read hardware fingerprint (BIOS UUID, CPU, MAC)<br/>Derive canonical 64-bit DeviceID<br/>Generate or load Ed25519 Identity Keypair
    HostDaemon-->>HostUI: Return Pairing Payload (DeviceID + Ed25519 Public Key)
    HostUI->>HostUI: Display QR Code & 6-digit Pairing PIN

    alt Method A: Scan QR Code via Mobile App
        Admin->>API: Mobile App submits authenticated claim request with scanned payload
    else Method B: Enter 6-digit PIN on Web Dashboard
        Admin->>API: Dashboard submits POST /api/v1/devices/claim { DeviceID, PairingPIN }
    end

    API->>API: Verify Admin Account JWT & Organization Permissions
    API->>DB: Bind DeviceID to Organization & User Record
    API->>HostDaemon: Dispatch Confirmed Pairing Notice via WebSocket
    Note over HostDaemon: Save Account Binding Certificate in OS Protected Vault<br/>Enable Unattended Access Policy
    HostUI-->>Admin: Display Success Badge: "Device Paired to Admin Account"
